      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've at least found a temporary way to make the orange outlines glow:\n\n1. Spawn Tabetchane from action menu\n\n2. Open action menu again, highlight Tabetchane so it gets orange highlights.\n\n3. Press R to close the action menu. The orange highlights disappear.\n\n4. Open main menu (Esc), open inventory. Put away Tabetchane and take it out again. The newly Tabetchane will have orange glowing outlines.\n\n5. (Open the action menu again. The orange glowing outlines will disappear.)\n\nI don't know how to make this persistent while the action menu is open, yet.",
