  "details": "It seems my Tabetchane follower received orange glowing outlines a few minutes after spawning when not selected/highlighted - blue outlines when selected. Other Tabetchane followers from other users don't have glowing outlines.\n\nPutting away and taking Tabetchane out again removed the glowing outlines, for a few minutes.\n\nI don't know how to reproduce this, but reportedly this has happened for other users previously too. It's not any other avatar with custom shaders, not my avatar, and probably not the world (VRChat Official Pride Hub), because the bug is reproducible while Safe Mode is active. No friends in the instance.",
